 "description": "Whatiffy — what if, then what?\n\nAnimated \"What If\" stories where YOU get one impossible rule, and we follow it all the way to the end.\n\nWhat if no one could ever say no to you? What if you could see everyone's price tag? What if your bank account matched your school grades?\n\nEvery episode is an original story. We write each script from scratch, work out the rules of the power and what they cost, and animate every scene for this channel. No reuploads, no compilations, no clips from other creators. When a video uses real facts, the sources are listed in its description.\n\nYou get the power. You pay the price. You make the call.\n\nGot a what-if of your own? Drop it in the comments.\n\n",
